      "body": "These notes close AMC Algebra with three reference sections. Return to them when you want to locate an explanation, recall a definition, or check the book's sources.\n\nThe <a href=\"#/learn/amc-algebra/l15/2\">Index</a> links key terms to the lessons that teach or use them. The <a href=\"#/learn/amc-algebra/l15/3\">Glossary</a> gives definitions and descriptions of those ideas. <a href=\"#/learn/amc-algebra/l15/4\">References and Credits</a> records the writing and contest sources, attribution, and further reading.\n\nSearch this book lists matching lessons, glossary definitions and Index entries. Choose an Index result to see all the lessons listed for that term in this book, then follow a lesson link to its explanation and worked examples."
